itle_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1311133006:1":{"text":"サイレンシアは両親が僕のために植えた手向けの花だ。でも今は、咲き誇る花の中で、僕が二人の墓を見守っている。","source_cn":"我死之后，我的父母将哀思寄托在永寂花里。现在永寂花仍然...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF55F740CC0CAC676","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1311133007:1":{"text":"それが、グレイヴボーンになる代償だよ。","source_cn":"这就是成为亡灵必须承受的代价。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE56712CA030AFED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1311133008:1":{"text":"サイレンシア……？","source_cn":"永寂花……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FA0A95716F9CCA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1311133009:1":{"text":"宴会用広間のテーブルや額縁を埋め尽くしている白い花のことだよ。","source_cn":"你们见到过，生长在主宴厅里，那些将宴席长桌与画框淹没的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79125D45918D6A00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1311133010:1":{"text":"あれは死者への手向けの花だ。かすかな香りを漂わせる、白く寂しげな姿は、まるで「死」そのものだろう？","source_cn":"它们是献给亡者的花。苍白、孤寂，带着淡淡的冷香……和死...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD13D615EB0FD2A79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1311133011:1":{"text":"あなたの気持ちは分かるわ。","source_cn":"柳博米尔……我明白你的感受。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF989A806FFD98179","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1311133012:1":{"text":"不死は恩恵でもあり、呪いでもあるのよね。","source_cn":"永远地活着……是恩赐，更是一种诅咒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70600A606040396F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1311133013:1":{"text":"だからこの者たちを連れてきたのか？だが理解したところで何になる？生者も、我々死者も、結局のところ死神の手からは逃れられない。","source_cn":"所以你才带他们来找我？但即便他们明白了又能如何呢，他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AB13EACBDD0C093","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1311133014:1":{"text":"……行こう。苦き旅の続きだ。","source_cn":"……好了，我们继续吧，这场苦旅仍未结束。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x751886A07074E0E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:柳博米尔":{"text":"リュボミル","source":"柳博米尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦丽卡":{"text":"ヴェリカ","source":"瓦丽卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":3}}